db/ensure "eacdeab8-8835-50c6-922a-b26dc67098ab" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d"] [:db/add "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d" :answer-field/choices "eacdeab8-8835-50c6-922a-b26dc67098ab"] [:db/add "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d" :answer-field/correct "eacdeab8-8835-50c6-922a-b26dc67098ab"] [:db/ensure "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8" :question/id #uuid "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8"] [:db/add "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 2} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 2} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\frac{3^{x^{3} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8" :question/answer-fields "9d7797d5-db3b-57b9-b4e7-eb270b2f983d"] [:db/ensure "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions "5c862b91-ffa3-5f06-b881-ebf3f3e052f8"] [:db/add "bc333d